  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CREATES - IUCN Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project focusses on: 
1. Enabling environment: strengthening governance arrangements for transboundary water management 
(TWM) and improving the ability of institutions to deliver on mandates and operationalize policy and 
regulatory frameworks to ensure resource mobilization, political dialogue and conflict prevention.
2. Sustainable infrastructure for water resources management: Facilitating the development of climate resilient water infrastructure combined with nature-based solutions that support inclusive and sustainable water management and improved livelihoods in targeted transboundary water basins.</narrative>
  </description>
